{"success":true,"data":{"id":43,"displayOrder":43,"titleKo":"무신사 넥스트 패션 스콜라십(MNFS) 6기 파이널리스트 발표","titleEn":"Musinsa Next Fashion Scholarship (MNFS) 6th Finalists Announced","titleJa":"無神社ネクストファッションスコラシップ（MNFS）6期ファイナリスト発表","titleZh":"Musinsa Next Fashion Scholarship (MNFS) 第六届决赛入围名单公布","contentKo":"<figure class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-fullwidth\" style=\"max-width:1056px\"><div><img src=\"https://d3a9ls0n8d3jx7.cloudfront.net/newsroom-images/notice_43_content_0.jpg\" alt=\"__wf_reserved_inherit\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" /></div></figure><p>&zwj;</p><div>\n  무신사 넥스트 패션 스콜라십 6기 파이널리스트를 아래와 같이 발표합니다.<br /><br />\n  1차 전문가 심사 점수와 2차 온라인 대중 투표 결과를 거쳐,<br />\n  최종 파이널 브랜드가 선정되었습니다.<br /><br />\n\n  <span style=\"font-size:1.15em;font-weight:bold\">&lt;MNFS Finalist TOP3&gt;</span><br /><br />\n  \n  <span style=\"font-size:1.15em\">\n    수더넴 (PSEUDONYM)<br />\n    오기 (OGI)<br />\n    이양 (EYANG)\n  </span>\n\n  <br /><br />\n  선정된 파이널 브랜드는 파이널 지원 혜택의 일환으로<br />\n  4월 성수 오프라인 팝업 스토어에서 직접 만나보실 수 있습니다.<br /><br />\n\n  파이널 브랜드의 다음 여정에 많은 관심과 응원 부탁드립니다.<br />\n  감사합니다.\n</div>","contentEn":"<figure class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-fullwidth\" style=\"max-width:1056px\"><div><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60a3629e04f26d12caff56df/69859d2b97c5f9fa984b8ab7_MNFS6%EA%B0%80_%ED%8C%8C%EC%9D%B4%EB%84%90%EB%A6%AC%EC%8A%A4%ED%8A%B8%EB%B0%9C%ED%91%9C_260209%20(4).jpg\" alt=\"__wf_reserved_inherit\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" /></div></figure><p>&zwj;</p><div>We are pleased to announce the finalists for the 6th Musinsa Next Fashion Scholarship.<br /><br />\nAfter the first round of expert evaluation scores and the second round of online public voting,<br />The final brand has been selected.<br /><br />\n\n  <span style=\"font-size:1.15em;font-weight:bold\">&lt;MNFS Finalist TOP3&gt;</span><br /><br />\n  \n  <span style=\"font-size:1.15em\">\nPSEUDONYM<br />OGI<br />\nEYANG\n</span>\n\n  <br /><br />\nThe selected final brands will receive support as part of the final support benefits.<br />You can see it in person at the Seongsu offline pop-up store in April.<br /><br />\n\nWe ask for your continued interest and support for the next journey of the Final Brand.<br />\n  thank you.\n</div>","contentJa":"<figure class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-fullwidth\" style=\"max-width:1056px\"><div><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60a3629e04f26d12caff56df/69859d2b97c5f9fa984b8ab7_MNFS6%EA%B0%80_%ED%8C%8C%EC%9D%B4%EB%84%90%EB%A6%AC%EC%8A%A4%ED%8A%B8%EB%B0%9C%ED%91%9C_260209%20(4).jpg\" alt=\"__wf_reserved_inherit\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" /></div></figure><p>&zwj;</p><div>\n  無神社ネクストファッションスコラシップ6期ファイナリストを以下のように発表します。<br /><br />\n  一次専門家審査スコアと二次オンライン大衆投票結果を経て、<br />\n  ファイナルファイナルブランドが選ばれました。<br /><br />\n\n  <span style=\"font-size:1.15em;font-weight:bold\">&lt;MNFS Finalist TOP3&gt;</span><br /><br />\n  \n  <span style=\"font-size:1.15em\">\n    スデネム（PSEUDONYM）<br />\n    オギ(OGI)<br />\n    イヤン（EYANG）\n  </span>\n\n  <br /><br />\n  選ばれたファイナルブランドはファイナルサポート特典の一環として<br />\n  4月の聖水オフラインポップアップストアで直接お会いできます。<br /><br />\n\n  ファイナルブランドの次の旅に、多くの関心と応援お願いします。<br />\n  ありがとうございます。\n</div>","contentZh":"<figure class=\"w-richtext-figure-type-image w-richtext-align-fullwidth\" style=\"max-width:1056px\"><div><img src=\"https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/60a3629e04f26d12caff56df/69859d2b97c5f9fa984b8ab7_MNFS6%EA%B0%80_%ED%8C%8C%EC%9D%B4%EB%84%90%EB%A6%AC%EC%8A%A4%ED%8A%B8%EB%B0%9C%ED%91%9C_260209%20(4).jpg\" alt=\"__wf_reserved_inherit\" width=\"auto\" height=\"auto\" /></div></figure><p>&zwj;</p><div>我们很高兴地宣布第六届 Musinsa Next 时尚奖学金的决赛入围者名单。<br /><br />在第一轮专家评分和第二轮网络公众投票之后，<br />最终品牌已选定。<br /><br />\n\n  <span style=\"font-size:1.15em;font-weight:bold\"></span><br /><br />\n  \n  <span style=\"font-size:1.15em\">笔名<br />OGI<br />EYANG\n\n</span>\n\n  <br /><br />最终入选的品牌将获得最终支持方案的一部分。<br />您可以在四月份前往圣水线下快闪店亲自体验。<br /><br />\n\n我们恳请您继续关注并支持Final Brand的下一步发展。<br />\n  